WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 14:1-15:10 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2615), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-10-26.

1
00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.650
Now the tax collectors and sinners

2
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.940
were all gathering around to hear Jesus.

3
00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.650
But the Pharisees and the teachers of the law muttered,

4
00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:04.200
This man welcomes sinners and eats with them.

5
00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:08.300
Then Jesus told them this parable.

6
00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.350
Suppose one of you has a hundred sheep and loses one of them.

7
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.930
Doesn't he leave the ninety-nine in the open country

8
00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:21.300
and go after the lost sheep until he finds it?

9
00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.800
And when he finds it,

10
00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:31.600
he joyfully puts it on his shoulders and goes home.

11
00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.900
Then he calls his friends and neighbors together and says,

12
00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.400
Rejoice with me; I have found my lost sheep.

13
00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:48.190
I tell you that in the same way

14
00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:52.050
there will be more rejoicing in heaven over one sinner who repents

15
00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:57.900
than over ninety-nine righteous persons who do not need to repent.

16
00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:04.650
Or suppose a woman has ten silver coins and loses one.

17
00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:13.180
Doesn't she light a lamp, sweep the house

18
00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.550
and search carefully until she finds it?

19
00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.400
And when she finds it,

20
00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.200
she calls her friends and neighbors together and says,

21
00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.900
Rejoice with me; I have found my lost coin.

22
00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.550
In the same way, I tell you,

23
00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.750
there is rejoicing in the presence of the angels of God

24
00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.950
over one sinner who repents.
